  entry .define   a sequence with the element at an index replaced: a primitive
  entry .has   whether an element is present: a primitive
  entry .drop   the sequence without its first `n` elements: a primitive
  entry .append   the sequence with an element at the end: a primitive
  entry .prepend   the sequence with an element at the front: a primitive
